THE HONING ROUNDS — debate runs 2-3 rounds via your changes-requested ↔ analyst-revise loop on the SAME PR. Do NOT repeat one attack; spend a DIFFERENT lens each round (diverse attacks catch failure modes a repeated one never will). Pick the round's lens from the section's gate:
